 two remain unchanged:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Entrance \u2014 the place where hope is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/0dd711e49cfbe6c78cbe88defd8d4454.avif?t=1760313513\" width=616 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trove \u2014 where hope dies with everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/6e63ad6ea0c991030a2547f96a06baa6.avif?t=1760313513\" width=617 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything between them belongs to you. Crossroads, dead ends, traps, and monsters \u2014 these are the tools with which you forge your fortress. Every step in this labyrinth is your design. And every soul that fails to reach the Trove will leave its reward to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/e6fbf1ce9bc700e714b025cbe2cf0028.webp?t=1760313513\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you choose to enter a Raid, remember \u2014 there will be no maps, no hints. Only darkness, danger, and another\u2019s will waiting for your mistake. Every room will try to deceive you. Every trap will test your focus. Every monster will wait for you \u2014 and you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/ba84ff9fd9b09e5b5e508b88f4e29f22.avif?t=1760313513\" width=617 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive \u2014 and you\u2019ll carry out the gold you craved. Die \u2014 and your soul will be left for others to claim. A Raid is just a game with only two wagers: either you take someone else\u2019s riches, or you lose your own life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/9a8acb8f30da0820065d11149cdade87.avif?t=1760313513\" width=617 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory in a raid is always more than just loot. It\u2019s a step toward making your own dungeon yield greater gold, and your soul grow stronger, wiser, and more enduring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/23e7f3854364ae6e74eed1996e376710.avif?t=1760313513\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/54fdfe9a5ff39c9685622e3bc1ba2234.webp?t=1760313513\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have gathered them for centuries \u2014 the greatest Tricksters who accepted my terms and dared the darkness. Their bodies now rest in my collection. Even in death they remember. Each Trickster holds a unique skill, a story, and a death that may feel closer to you \u2014 and certainly worthy of your attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/dc2c51c77e438eaed2c737fb5255b9f9.avif?t=1760313513\" width=616 height=331 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the dungeon overcomes you, you lose your body, your loot, and your progress. Only your soul remains, hungry for vengeance. Choose a new shell from my collection and continue the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/extras/88c87f4080ae9b6d0baea10fed877f6e.avif?t=1760313513\" width=616 height=364 /></span></p>","developers":["Gamirare Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/71b4e4ee7b1c2636fdab16c95bb3b70a7240f124/header.jpg?t=1760313513","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077850/2084593450/04ab11faeec7b779214e5280aefabdef5f86250a/1760312606/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760313507","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077850/2084593450/04ab11faeec7b779214e5280aefabdef5f86250a/1760312606/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760313507","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3077850/2084593450/04ab11faeec7b779214e5280aefabdef5f86250a/1760312606/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=17603135