 be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/9bd8c0de2589368704e9c35ed9659f1c82796cc3/ss_9bd8c0de2589368704e9c35ed9659f1c82796cc3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/9bd8c0de2589368704e9c35ed9659f1c82796cc3/ss_9bd8c0de2589368704e9c35ed9659f1c82796cc3.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/662c0c679e8bc062bada549de6d10ae9bcb96415/ss_662c0c679e8bc062bada549de6d10ae9bcb96415.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/662c0c679e8bc062bada549de6d10ae9bcb96415/ss_662c0c679e8bc062bada549de6d10ae9bcb96415.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/4f8a2e9f96fc6036bc677e088dd12623aa51ae73/ss_4f8a2e9f96fc6036bc677e088dd12623aa51ae73.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/4f8a2e9f96fc6036bc677e088dd12623aa51ae73/ss_4f8a2e9f96fc6036bc677e088dd12623aa51ae73.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/c36ce47fb11e9f83cdeca2f3f6e1282855894601/ss_c36ce47fb11e9f83cdeca2f3f6e1282855894601.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/c36ce47fb11e9f83cdeca2f3f6e1282855894601/ss_c36ce47fb11e9f83cdeca2f3f6e1282855894601.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/3610699931f865e85cf551b75270d9b3b7791af3/ss_3610699931f865e85cf551b75270d9b3b7791af3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/3610699931f865e85cf551b75270d9b3b7791af3/ss_3610699931f865e85cf551b75270d9b3b7791af3.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/90949944b3ce32e67a27747eb763029db02104fd/ss_90949944b3ce32e67a27747eb763029db02104fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/90949944b3ce32e67a27747eb763029db02104fd/ss_90949944b3ce32e67a27747eb763029db02104fd.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/3b4cbdb1e1aec82670c8003d3f39ed29b439d9c9/ss_3b4cbdb1e1aec82670c8003d3f39ed29b439d9c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760313513","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077850/3b4cbdb1e1aec82670c8003d3f39ed29b439d9c9/ss_3b4cbdb1e1aec82670c8003d3f39ed29b439d9c9.600x338.jpg?t=1760313513"}],"short_description":"In a world created by The Entity, tricksters build deadly labyrinths and delve into others creations, chasing gold, power, and souls. Each victory increases your strength, while every death feeds the world that consumes you, a dark fantasy PvPvE where greed is survival, and no soul ever finds peace.","steam_appid":3077850,"support_info":{"email":"olfamelles@gamirare.com","url":"https://gamirare.com"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Polish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://gamirare.com/"}